Package: calibratedDML
Type: Package
Title: Calibrated and Adaptive Debiased Machine Learning for Causal Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Lars van der Laan
Maintainer: Lars van der Laan <lvdlaan@uw.edu>
Description: Implements calibrated debiased machine learning estimators for
    categorical treatments, including mean potential outcomes, treatment-vs-control
    contrasts, and adaptive binary-treatment extensions based on plug-in and
    R-learner calibration. The package supports direct nuisance-matrix input,
    lightweight built-in models, and optional integration with sl3 and
    SuperLearner.
License: GPL-3
